# Cloudflare Pages header rules.
#
# The single-threaded engine build (stockfish-18-lite-single) runs without any
# special headers, so nothing is required today.
#
# To switch to the multi-threaded build, SharedArrayBuffer must be available,
# which requires cross-origin isolation. Uncomment the two headers below, then:
#   1. ENGINE_VARIANT=lite npm run fetch-engine
#   2. set VITE_ENGINE_WORKER_URL=/engine/stockfish-18-lite.js
#   3. set VITE_ENGINE_THREADS to the desired thread count
# No application code changes are needed. See src/engine/config.ts.
#
# /*
#   Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
#   Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
